  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "没有固定玩家角色，敌方机器人都能成为临时宿主，并以各自招式、流派和升级体系继续战斗。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Every enemy is a potential host. Switch control at a moment’s notice between unique enemy types, each with a distinct moveset and playstyle, and their own arsenal of upgrades to unlock.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2256450/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "战斗风格分直接充当局内货币，熟练技巧和花式射击可换取改变各类宿主运作方式的升级。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "RAM expands the style systems seen in games like Devil May Cry and Ultrakill by making style points in-run currency. Master combat techniques and execute trickshots to earn a diverse array of upgrades that modify how each host robot functions, then pit your accumulated strength against dangerous bosses with their own unique swap-related mechanics.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2256450/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "玩家将穿越人类废墟中的程序生成关卡，面对在末日后崛起的古怪机械社会。",
      "dimension": "题材",
      "excerpt": "Traverse the ruins of the human world across multiple procedurally-generated levels, and contend with the eccentric mechanical societies that have risen to inhabit them.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2256450/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
